# ryuxik.io · redirects for the Cloudflare Workers static-assets deploy.
# Consumed as config, never served. Evaluated BEFORE public/_headers.
# Limits: 2000 static + 100 dynamic rules, 1000 characters per rule.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# !! WHERE THE www -> apex REDIRECT LIVES !!
# Workers Assets matches `source` as a PATH. It cannot match on hostname, and
# wrangler REJECTS any rule with an absolute URL outright (error 100324,
# "Only relative URLs are allowed") — the deploy fails, it is not ignored.
# So the canonical-host redirect exists ONLY as a zone-level Single Redirect
# in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   Cloudflare dashboard -> ryuxik.io -> Rules -> Redirect Rules
#     Rule "WWW to root":
#     If:   hostname equals www.ryuxik.io
#     Then: dynamic redirect, 301, preserve query string,
#           expression: concat("https://ryuxik.io", http.request.uri.path)
# Do NOT re-add the rule here, even as documentation: it breaks every deploy.
